    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab9df99abf087.01979796\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Holly Longdale has announced that Blizzard has increased the WoW: Forever Beta population cap again!<br><br>The WoW: Forever Beta is a very popular game and has been taking the internet by storm. Apparently, it's been so popular that Holly Longdale has announced that they've had to increase the WoW: Forever beta population cap again!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-bluetweet exclude-units\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wowheadtweets/status/2104270224568541611\">Tweet #2104270224568541611</a></div></div><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Holly Longdale<span class=\"quote-said-text\"> said: </span></div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">So... we had to increase the WoW: Forever Beta population cap again. The wild ride continues. ❤️ #warcraft</div></div>Blizzard has also been looking into to an issue where the queue was filling and they have fixed the issue.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2363282/19\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units first\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2363282/17\" target=\"_blank\">Supersonic</a><span class=\"quote-said-text\"> said: </span></div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-header-link\" href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2363282/17\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Getting login queue after disconnect</div></div>We looked into this, and found an issue that was causing the queue to fill, and we just fixed the issue.<br><br>Thanks for testing with us!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Holly Longdale has announced that Blizzard has increased the WoW: Forever Beta population cap again!<br /><br />The WoW: Forever Beta is a very popular game and has been taking the internet by storm. Apparently, it's been so popular that Holly Longdale has announced that they've had to increase the WoW: Forever beta population cap again!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\"><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Holly Longdale</h2>So... we had to increase the WoW: Forever Beta population cap again. The wild ride continues. ❤️ #warcraft</div><br /><br />Blizzard has also been looking into to an issue where the queue was filling and they have fixed the issue. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br />Getting login queue after disconnect<br /></div></div><br />We looked into this, and found an issue that was causing the queue to fill, and we just fixed the issue.<br /><br />Thanks for testing with us!</noscript>            \n        ",
